---
title: Easy French Ratatouille
description: Make this thick and silky French stew of eggplant, zucchini, sweet peppers, and ripe summer tomatoes before summer ends.
image: https://cdn.apartmenttherapy.info/image/upload/f_jpg,q_auto:eco,c_fill,g_auto,w_1500,ar_16:9/k%2Farchive%2F92146e3b2e0941f33e421c6a63951db0ed4a7c6b
servings: 8
nutrition:
  calories: 137 cal
  fat: 9.0 g
  saturated fat: 1.3 g
  carbohydrates: 13.9 g
  sugar: 8.0 g
  protein: 3.0 g
  fiber: 5.3 g
  sodium: 645.9 mg
  serving size: Serves 8
